version: "1.0.0"



abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for a biologically informed machine-learning
  framework for malaria-incidence prediction using
  vectorial-capacity-derived information. The repository contains the
  processed analytical dataset, data-preparation procedures,
  environmentally parameterized vectorial-capacity construction,
  feature-ablation experiments, Random Forest and Gradient Boosting
  modelling pipelines, country-grouped and temporal evaluation
  procedures, bootstrap comparisons, and data underlying the reported
  tables and empirical figures. The study evaluates whether
  vectorial-capacity-derived information provides incremental predictive
  information beyond historical malaria incidence and conventional
  environmental predictors using country-level data from sub-Saharan
  Africa.

